WEBVTT

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.780
The barrier has been broken?

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.970
And by brute force, at that...

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.190
What did you say?

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.160
Who did it?!

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.210
Excuse me. It looks like I 
knocked a little too hard.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.400
Sakuya!

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.590
Is it time for my morning feecof?

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.670
Idiot! Stay away!

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.780
This is a surprise.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:36.180
I never expected Lady Key to be here, too.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:36.970
What?!

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:40.460
As long as I'm collecting Kotori-san, 
why don't I bring you, too?

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.430
Oh, do not fret.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:45.230
We will be very hospitable 
to you both over at Gaia.

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:46.100
Sakuya!

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.450
If you're going to pretend to be a knight,

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:52.360
weak as you are, I hope you'll
show me everything you've got.

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:55.490
Okay, then. I'll do this!

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:56.960
What is this?

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.620
Yay! You finally showed up!

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:00.440
Gil?

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.900
Now, I will get my revenge!

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.020
Okay, Sensei, please take care of him!

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:07.790
Gil-chan, you are so pathetic.

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:10.130
As you can see, my spies have been exposed.

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:14.430
Do you understand how perilous 
the current situation has become?

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:23.220
With that said, are you in need
 of an all-purpose butler

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:26.560
who can cook, clean,
do the laundry, and even fight?

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:29.210
Huh?

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.530
<b>I'm a traitor.</b>

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:04.140
It was a spur of the moment thing!

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.700
Episode 10
"Simply, As Friends"

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.540
I simply got mixed up in all of this!

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:08.540
It is a fine barrier.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:10.450
However, and pardon me for saying so,

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:13.630
it would be a bit lacking in
both defense and strength

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.530
if pitted against top-rate 
monster users or superhumans.

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:18.550
I-Is that right?

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:22.560
So, that's how you sent those 
two here to manipulate us?

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:23.380
Yes.

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:27.020
Well, to be precise, <i>I</i> was the one sent here.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:27.690
Huh?

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.560
It appears we will need to take 
some precautionary measures.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.870
Can you take care of this, Sakuya?

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:37.320
Please watch Tennouji, and if possible, 
any activity in his vicinity.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.570
Huh? I would prefer not.

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:39.570
Hey!

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.580
Well, jokes aside,

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:44.650
doing so would mean leaving 
Chihaya-san's side.

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:45.700
It's all right!

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:46.870
After all, look!

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:50.700
I have this power that you gave me, Sakuya!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.120
Understood.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:57.820
The president and Chihaya sent you?

00:03:57.820 --> 00:04:01.410
But I cannot act too overtly,
given Chihaya-san's position.

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.470
Support is all I can offer.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:06.360
Not a problem!
Having you here is really reassuring!

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.910
Thank you very much.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:10.980
Please allow me to
support you as your butler.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.480
In that case, train me!

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:17.910
Please.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.100
My intensive training is very strict.

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:36.130
How long are you gonna keep me waiting?!

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:37.320
Oh dear.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:39.720
You're so impatient, Slowtarou-kun.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:45.010
Half-baked imitations of my skills won't
help you take on professionals or monsters.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.180
If there is anything that 
I can impart upon you,

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:54.330
it is pain and experience.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:55.910
That won't do.

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:58.560
You can't let your mind go blank over
something so minor during combat.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:01.490
Oh, please use the blades 
in your right hand as well.

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:03.400
It will be over in a second otherwise.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.900
Fine! To hell with it!

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.830
K-Kagari!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.110
Wh-What is it?

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:16.040
Kotori, what is Kotarou doing?

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:17.840
Intensive training with Sakuya-san.

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:19.040
Don't interrupt them, okay?

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:21.920
He's working hard for your sake.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.600
Good! Let him have it!

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:12.660
Kagari-san, you are so loved!

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:17.650
When a man starts pushing himself this hard,
it's usually for the one he loves.

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:19.230
Loves?

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:21.900
He's working hard for your sake.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.030
You're all beat up.

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:28.900
Right, Kagari?

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.280
Let me give you this.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:36.540
It is supreme feecof,
which Kotori taught me how to brew.

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:38.130
You made this?

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:40.150
What brought this on?

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.290
How is my Kagari-chan blend?

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.410
This is definitely your sort of flavor.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.550
But thanks.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:50.760
Huh?

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:51.730
Hey, what are you doing?

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:52.420
Oh.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.500
Have you all gotten together for a tea party?

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.810
Kagari made us all coffee.

00:06:56.980 --> 00:06:58.680
Would you also like some, Sakuya-san?

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.930
That is very intriguing!

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:02.850
I'll gladly have some.

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:07.350
It is quite... skillfully made...

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:11.820
I-In gratitude, allow me to serve you coffee 
I have put all of my skill into making.

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:17.330
Your feecof is gross, Sakuya.

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:20.820
You broke his heart!

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:25.040
Frankly, coffee that's on sale for
55 yen a can is good enough for Kagari.

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:26.920
How foolish!

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:28.350
Very well!

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:30.670
I will show you what a butler 
is really capable of!

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:34.800
Why don't you direct even one percent 
of that enthusiasm toward me?

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:41.310
All right!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.690
Damn it!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:10.090
Damn!

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.570
We have completely run out of supplies!

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:23.860
Huh? For real?

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:27.150
It was originally only supposed 
to be me and Kagari here,

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.100
so we need to go shopping.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:31.900
I'll go, then.

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:35.580
It's boring here,
and Sakuya's feecof is gross.

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:40.290
Uh, the butler over there is in
a rather hilarious state right now...

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:44.290
I don't really want to let 
Kagari leave this place...

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:47.460
Then, I shall accompany her as a guard.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:50.070
Luckily, the Harvest Festa 
starts in the city today.

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:53.670
Neither Guardian nor Gaia should 
have perfect surveillance in place.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:12.820
Okay. I'm counting on you for the rest.

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.040
Gotcha!

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.040
I'm on the ball again today!

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.180
Come on. Let's go to the library.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:22.000
Sounds good!

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:24.200
That was close.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:27.230
I've been holed up in the forest 
and skipping school lately,

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:30.540
so it's kind of hard to 
face the guys from class.

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:31.780
Well, then.

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:33.920
Now that we've finished shopping,

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:36.050
there is someone I would 
like the two of you to meet.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.940
And who would that be?

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:41.930
Go ahead. Right through here.

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:49.440
Welcome, Gypsy,

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:51.770
to my mystical room.

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:59.680
It wasn't even that long ago,
but this is kind of nostalgic, President.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.880
You're right. It really is.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:06.830
However, I'm not here today as 
the president of the occult club.

00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:10.080
I'm here as the Martel Group's next saint.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.250
Saint?

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:12.990
Wait, Martel?

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:15.840
On the surface, it's an 
environmental protection agency,

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.920
but behind the scenes,

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:22.470
it's an organization that has waged bloody war
over the Key since ancient times...

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.100
Gaia.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.700
Gaia was actually the Martel Group?

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.490
So that's where your mysterious 
influence came from?

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:33.440
Kagari-san, wasn't it?

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:37.610
If you can understand me, then there is 
something I've always wanted to ask you.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:40.130
For what purpose does an avatar of the planet

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:43.990
go out of its way to judge human beings,
as trifling as we are?

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:45.400
I don't know.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:48.050
I'm currently searching for myself.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:50.580
I think I'll understand
once I find what I'm looking for.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.340
P-President?

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:57.500
What the hell?

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:00.240
If that's how you are,

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:01.840
then what have I...

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:09.230
Even petty, minuscule humans have 
created many wonderful things.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.360
Like the Internet, and the Internet...

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:14.700
And this feecof is right up there.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.480
I will give it to you, so cheer up.

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:22.740
Of the gifts Kotarou has given me,
feecof is my favorite.

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:26.040
Something like this won over the Key?

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:33.460
Tennouji, remember this?

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.540
If I recall, this is from back then...

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.050
25) You have power, and are discontent with this world. Tell me, 
do you wish to change this world? Or do you wish to change yourself?

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.050
(1)The World   (2) Myself

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:40.170
I never expected you would answer like this.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.420
I don't know.

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:44.080
I will do what I can, in the place I belong.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:46.930
Even if it proves futile.

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:49.560
My time with you... No.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:56.940
My time with <i>all</i> of you wasn't bad.

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:58.290
See you.

00:11:58.290 --> 00:11:59.940
This really will be the last time we meet.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:02.280
Please wait, President.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.810
Aren't you forgetting something important?

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:06.240
Something important?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:06.790
Yes!

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:08.830
Namely, boobs!

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:11.330
Huh?

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:15.670
You promised I could touch your boobs
if I proved the occult exists!

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:18.970
This whole ordeal is,
without a doubt, the occult!

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:22.120
Hey! You bring that up now,
in this situation?

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:25.790
Boobs transcend all reason and situations!

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:27.070
That's just how boobs work!

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:28.350
Wh-Why you...

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:30.220
What's all this about boobs?

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:32.160
There! Go fetch!

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.230
Wait!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.020
That nuisance is gone!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:39.140
Y-You beast!

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:42.430
Oh, fine!

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:44.180
Do whatever you want!

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:45.530
I'll help myself, then!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.800
Time's up.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.500
I've got to get back.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.160
Huh?

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:58.670
We'll continue this in
the occult club room sometime.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:01.550
You fool.

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:05.720
According to the analytics team,

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:09.930
it's extremely likely that
the Key has appeared this year.

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:12.680
We can expect it to show up
at one of these three points.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:15.140
What is that one differently colored spot?

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.050
That's the forest.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:20.320
There's a wide area we can't get
a consistent read on from aerial maps.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.360
It's rather suspicious.

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:24.160
Oh, right. We have new intel.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.840
We aren't sure of the connection,

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:27.610
but we've confirmed this schoolgirl

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:30.390
has been in the same area repeatedly.

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:37.460
Please leave scouting that area to me!

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:39.930
Trust me, I'm definitely <i>not</i>
considering a cover-up

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:42.960
in case that girl turns out
 to be my friend Kotori!

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:47.260
They delegated me to logistical 
support for some reason...

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:49.850
It's an all-too-reasonable decision.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:53.320
But why did Kotori disappear, 
only to show up in the forest?

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:55.350
Could Kotori be part of Gaia, too?

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:58.180
Kotarou disappeared, too.

00:13:58.180 --> 00:13:59.860
I have to do something.

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:02.490
Shizuru, forget about the occult club,

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.360
and Kotarou and the others already.

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.820
Lucia!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:08.380
For now, focus on subduing the Key.

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.160
Okay?

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:13.730
Jeez!

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:16.710
We're late because you left the 
luggage with Chibi-moth-san

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.140
and went on a side trip!

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:20.880
It's fine to slack off once in a while!

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:21.780
Okay.

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:24.180
The entrance to the barrier 
is around here, right?

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:25.830
Please be careful.

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:29.260
Gaia's monster users occasionally 
patrol this area.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:30.880
Miss Kotori!

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:33.060
We just got back!

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.940
What an ugly sight.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:44.420
After consuming this planet 
to their heart's content,

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:48.030
they do not even realize that there 
is nothing remaining underfoot.

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:50.400
Truly foolish.

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.410
That is true.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.910
Your face betrays your lingering attachment.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:58.050
When I took custody of you, you were empty,

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:00.710
so I'm glad you grew up into
such a fine young lady.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:04.460
However, you will most definitely 
yearn for destruction.

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:07.510
That is the burden we saints must bear.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.750
I... am aware.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.690
Where do you think you're going, Shizuru?

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:27.700
Lucia, please overlook this.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:31.460
I'm sure you understand 
this isn't a situation

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:33.200
where you can act based on personal feelings.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.280
But Kotori is our—

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.570
If we leave the Key alone,

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:40.040
not only will Kotori and the others perish,
so will all of humanity!

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.680
I know that.

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:42.960
Even then, I...

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:49.460
You're disobeying orders?!

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:56.720
Lucia?

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:00.620
You're not thinking calmly at the moment.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.610
So I'll go instead.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:03.590
Don't worry.

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:05.110
I won't do anything bad.

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.020
Take this!

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.610
You're doing pretty well.

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:13.720
You are starting to make
fewer rash decisions.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:15.720
<i>"Pretty well" isn't enough.</i>

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:16.990
<i>In that case...</i>

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.340
That is one of those rash 
decisions I was talking about.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:25.290
Make sure not to rely on your 
rewrite ability so readily.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:27.290
Rewrite?

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.810
A power where you rewrite your own limits

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:32.420
and draw out your abilities freely.

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:34.800
So you <i>do</i> know about my power!

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:37.300
Yes, I know it well.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.810
I know that it comes at a hefty price, too.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.240
A price?

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.850
To be completely up front,

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:45.600
if you overuse it,
you will cease to be human.

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:48.060
There will be situations where 
you'll have to use it,

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:51.680
but when you do, keep it to the bare minimum.

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:53.350
Let's call it a day.

00:16:53.350 --> 00:16:54.770
Y-Yeah...

00:16:57.450 --> 00:16:59.330
Kotarou, can I ask you something?

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.420
Huh? What is it?

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:06.830
Why are you trying so hard?
It is a mystery to me.

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:08.390
Well...

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:09.980
To protect you?

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:12.800
Does that mean it's because you love me?

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.200
L-Love?!

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:16.070
Am I wrong?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.180
It is true that I'm doing it for you,

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.950
but I'm sure that's not all.

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:24.480
I'd been looking for a place
where I'd fit in for years.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.850
And I finally found it...

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:32.610
I hope this becomes a nice 
place where you fit right in.

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:35.240
But the place where I finally fit in

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.950
slipped through my fingers all too easily.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:41.020
<i>I won't lose it this time.</i>

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.250
<i>And...</i>

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.350
K-Kagari?

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:47.640
Ow!

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:48.960
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:50.340
Oh...

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:53.960
I have been very curious about your 
right arm since the other day.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:55.680
Curious...

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:57.000
Kagari?

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:58.380
Homo...

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:00.720
N-No! Who would even want to see SakuxKota?!

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:03.220
Homo...

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:05.480
Homo sapiens...

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:06.980
Kagari?

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:11.730
Is something the matter?

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.820
Don't give me that!

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:20.260
<i>This area is already Gaia territory.</i>

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:22.190
<i>Are you here, Kanbe Kotori?</i>

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.520
You're sure it's up ahead, Midou?

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:26.100
Yeah.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:29.090
I definitely saw some puny 
monsters go through the barrier.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.840
Is <i>it</i> really inside the barrier?

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:32.830
No doubt about it.

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:35.590
It's a presence I've felt plenty of 
times since coming to this country.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:37.630
It's the Key.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.380
You don't even have eyes 
that can discern the Key.

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:43.110
You're a beast, all right.

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:46.120
If what those puny monsters 
said is true, the Strongest

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:49.430
and that stray superhuman who can use 
that odd power should be there, too.

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:50.500
Not that I give a damn.

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:53.300
I'll crush them and the Key to pieces!

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:55.220
Not that it's anything new, but he's insane.

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:56.470
A little late to bring that up.

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.610
<i>A stray superhuman?</i>

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.330
<i>Could he mean Kotarou?</i>

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:02.240
<i>If so, Kanbe should also be there.</i>

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:04.070
<i>Why are they with the Key?</i>

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:05.740
<i>No, more importantly...</i>

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:09.750
<i>If I let them go,
I can confirm the Key's location.</i>

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:14.020
<i>However, if those two really are there,
they'll definitely be killed.</i>

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:16.330
<i>Don't hesitate!</i>

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:19.760
<i>The Key is our top priority!</i>

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:20.880
<i>Nothing else...</i>

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:25.140
You know, friends don't let
 friends be all alone.

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:31.640
I'm such an idiot.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:39.360
What could possibly take priority 
over protecting my friends?!

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:45.870
You want me to go to where Sakuya is?

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:46.780
Yes.

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:49.620
And not just for now. Forever.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:51.580
Wait, do you mean...

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.820
Leaving the organization.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:57.130
You were always skeptical of Gaia's 
policies anyway, weren't you?

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:01.260
B-But if I leave, who will help you?

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:04.660
Uh, the only job at this organization 
I could really leave to you

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:06.350
is looking after Shimako, anyway.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.400
You meanie!

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:11.280
That aside, can I ask you to
take care of something for me?

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:13.730
Understood...

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:18.260
<i>You're better off by Sakuya's side.</i>

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:19.800
<i>You're too kind,</i>

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:22.470
<i>so I doubt you could endure 
what's going to happen next.</i>

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:23.740
<i>This is war, after all.</i>

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:32.330
Damn! Tenma! Tenjin!

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:34.020
I haven't killed them.

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:35.210
You understand why, right?

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:37.420
You hunters are nasty!

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.850
If they die, it's all over,

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:41.410
but if they're left breathing, 
they're a burden!

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:45.130
I won't let a single person past this point!

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:46.970
<i>I'll end this before he summons his monster!</i>

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:55.230
You're a flame monster user?

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:57.730
Close, but no cigar.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:01.120
What's this?!

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:02.360
A lava monster?!

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:03.610
Correct!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:07.080
Come on, say hello, Fogo!

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:10.610
Give this to Tennouji.

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:11.740
A letter?

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:14.250
Yes, a very important one.

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:16.630
Once you meet up with 
Tennouji and the others,

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:20.500
choose whichever path you believe is best.

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:23.300
Once this is over and peace has returned,

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:25.010
let's all get together again.

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:26.100
Yes!

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:29.010
You, Kotarou, Kotori, Shizuru,

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:30.890
and Konohana-san!

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:33.560
You bastard!

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:34.640
What are you thinking?!

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:37.520
Don't you realize this is a forest?!

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:40.110
Yeah, it burns up real good!

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:44.900
That's a pretty neat trick you've got!

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:47.160
But how long can you keep it up?!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:59.450
Lava is mostly made up of silicon.

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:01.790
If you reconstitute it,

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:04.920
then as you can see, it crystallizes 
into silicon dioxide!

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:10.180
<i>His flames are a terrible match
 for my high-frequency blade!</i>

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:11.150
<i>In that case...</i>

00:22:13.970 --> 00:22:15.160
<i>I have no other choice!</i>

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:17.000
I'm sorry.

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:20.100
Hey, a hunter is kneeling before me?

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:22.690
What a laugh riot!

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:24.110
Don't misunderstand.

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:26.980
The one I'm apologizing to is this forest!

00:22:29.300 --> 00:22:30.070
What?!

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:33.350
My flames...

00:22:37.760 --> 00:22:39.580
What the hell did you do?

00:22:40.020 --> 00:22:41.700
No matter how much lava you may have,

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:44.170
it's pointless if there's nothing to burn.

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:45.670
You monster!

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:48.670
Yes, that's right.

00:22:48.670 --> 00:22:51.550
But even monsters have things 
they want to protect!

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:53.680
Yeah, yeah, keep talking!

00:22:58.300 --> 00:22:59.140
You moron!

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:00.810
It doesn't matter how 
many times you cut Fogo—

00:23:02.470 --> 00:23:03.640
Wh-What the?

00:23:03.640 --> 00:23:05.070
My body...

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:08.070
A monster and its master 
are linked, right?

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:10.320
Then, even if a slash has no effect,

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:12.230
poison should work.

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:15.330
Bingo, huh?

00:23:15.570 --> 00:23:17.650
Y-You bitch...

00:23:17.650 --> 00:23:18.740
Rest assured.

00:23:18.740 --> 00:23:20.140
I'll ease your pain now.

00:23:20.570 --> 00:23:21.750
You're pitying...

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:23.380
Looking down on me?

00:23:23.650 --> 00:23:26.840
Quit screwing with me!

00:23:53.810 --> 00:23:56.070
<i>Kotarou...</i>
